<p>Importing an Ubuntu export under a name such as <code v-pre>Debian-Backup</code> does <strong>not</strong> convert it to Debian. It creates another WSL distribution containing the same Ubuntu root filesystem. Install a clean Debian distribution and migrate only the files and configuration you need.</p>
